#: src/odbcconfig.c:575
msgid ""
"Open DataBase Connectivity (ODBC) was developed to be an Open and portable "
"standard for accessing data. unixODBC implements this standard for "
"Linux/UNIX."
msgstr ""
"Odprta podatkovna povezljivost (ODBC) je bila razvita kot prost in "
"prenosljiv standard za dostop do podatkov. unixODBC podpira ta standard za "
"Linux/UNIX."

